  message: "Fixed in PR #2828. Full TLA+ analyzer implemented: 6 symbol kinds (module, operator, constant, variable, theorem, assumption), EXTENDS/INSTANCE import edges, body reference edges. 25 tests at 100% coverage. Handles LOCAL, RECURSIVE, parameterized signatures, primed variables, unnamed theorem/assumption skipping."  # 8e59
